Options +FollowSymLinks
RewriteEngine on

# Permanent identifiers for the ME/CFS and Long COVID literature knowledge graph
# (AID-PAIS project): ontology terms, paper, author and release IRIs under
# https://w3id.org/mecfs/kg/ .
#
# Placeholder: until the vocabulary and data are published at a public location
# (Zenodo / GitHub Pages) every request goes to the maintainer's GitHub page.
# This file will be updated to redirect to the published resources.
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://github.com/JonasHeinickeBio [R=302,L]

